---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Talleres AutoMarcos - Taller Mecánico en Mallorca">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-dark via-dark to-darker py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486262715619-67b85e0b08d3?w=1920&q=80')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-15"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Tu taller mecánico de <span class="text-accent">confianza</span> en Mallorca
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Más de 20 años ofreciendo servicio profesional de reparación y mantenimiento de vehículos. Calidad, honestidad y compromiso con cada cliente.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contacto" class="px-8 py-4 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-dark text-dark font-bold rounded-xl transition-colors text-lg">
          Pedir Cita
        </a>
        <a href="/servicios" class="px-8 py-4 border-2 border-gray-500 hover:border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors text-lg">
          Nuestros Servicios
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Servicios destacados -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-darker">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Nuestros Servicios</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Ofrecemos una amplia gama de servicios para mantener tu vehículo en perfectas condiciones.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-accent/50 transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.066 2.573c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573 1.066c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066-2.573c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Mecánica General</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Diagnóstico y reparación completa de averías mecánicas de todo tipo de vehículos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-accent/50 transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Electricidad del Vehículo</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Diagnóstico electrónico, reparación de sistemas eléctricos y electrónicos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-accent/50 transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Cambio de Aceite</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Cambio de aceite y filtros con productos de primera calidad para alargar la vida de tu motor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-accent/50 transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Frenos</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Revisión, reparación y sustitución de sistemas de frenado. Tu seguridad es lo primero.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-accent/50 transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">ITV Pre-revisión</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Preparamos tu vehículo para pasar la ITV sin problemas. Revisión completa previa.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-800 hover:border-accent/50 transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-accent/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Neumáticos</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Venta, montaje y equilibrado de neumáticos de las mejores marcas del mercado.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mt-10">
        <a href="/servicios" class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-primary-light hover:bg-primary text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors">
          Ver todos los servicios
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Por qué elegirnos -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-dark">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">¿Por qué elegirnos?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-accent mb-2">20+</div>
          <p class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Años de experiencia</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-accent mb-2">5000+</div>
          <p class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Clientes satisfechos</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-accent mb-2">100%</div>
          <p class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Compromiso</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-accent mb-2">365</div>
          <p class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Días de garantía</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-dark to-primary">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">¿Necesitas una revisión?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-8">Contacta con nosotros y te daremos cita lo antes posible. Presupuesto sin compromiso.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/34600000000?text=Hola%2C%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20pedir%20cita%20en%20Talleres%20AutoMarcos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-bold rounded-xl transition-colors text-lg">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
        Escríbenos por WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
